WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.381 --> 00:00:13.431
Izzie and Nina were swinging high on the swings.

2
00:00:14.592 --> 00:00:17.174
They had just met at Kids Central a few weeks ago.

3
00:00:18.195 --> 00:00:19.416
But Izzie liked Nina.

4
00:00:19.436 --> 00:00:23.120
"Fall is my favorite season," Izzie said.

5
00:00:23.140 --> 00:00:27.584
"Yeah. I love fall too," Nina agreed.

6
00:00:31.436 --> 00:00:33.858
"Girls! Come get your sit-upons.

7
00:00:34.939 --> 00:00:36.080
You'll need them soon!"

8
00:00:36.561 --> 00:00:37.562
Miss Shelly called.

9
00:00:38.583 --> 00:00:41.185
It was time for the Kids Central activity of the day.

10
00:00:41.205 --> 00:00:44.568
"I wonder what we're doing," Izzie said.

11
00:00:48.872 --> 00:00:51.094
Miss Shelly was holding a brown paper bag.

12
00:00:52.155 --> 00:00:53.636
She wore tall rubber boots.

13
00:00:54.837 --> 00:00:56.139
"Out to the woods we go!"

14
00:00:56.679 --> 00:00:57.200
she said.

15
00:00:59.476 --> 00:01:01.637
Everyone followed Miss Shelly onto a path.

16
00:01:02.418 --> 00:01:03.798
The path went into the woods.

17
00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:09.101
"Here we are," Miss Shelly said.

18
00:01:09.121 --> 00:01:11.663
"Our campground for the day."

19
00:01:11.683 --> 00:01:14.184
"What are we doing here?"

20
00:01:14.664 --> 00:01:15.385
Izzie asked.

21
00:01:15.405 --> 00:01:18.507
"Can we put our sit-upons anywhere?"

22
00:01:18.867 --> 00:01:19.627
Bobby asked.

23
00:01:19.647 --> 00:01:24.230
"Anywhere that looks comfortable to sit," Miss Shelly answered.

24
00:01:25.510 --> 00:01:28.212
Miss Shelly emptied her shopping bag onto the ground.

25
00:01:29.484 --> 00:01:36.346
"For today's activity we'll use a fire, marshmallows, chocolate, and graham crackers.

26
00:01:37.366 --> 00:01:38.947
Can anyone guess what it is?"

27
00:01:38.967 --> 00:01:42.348
"S'mores!" Bobby yelled.

28
00:01:42.368 --> 00:01:43.868
"My favorite!"

29
00:01:43.888 --> 00:01:50.210
"Yum! My family makes s'mores when we go camping," Nina said.

30
00:01:50.230 --> 00:01:52.230
"What's a s'more?"

31
00:01:52.750 --> 00:01:53.451
Izzie asked.

32
00:01:54.691 --> 00:01:56.031
"What's a s'more?"

33
00:01:56.572 --> 00:01:58.032
Nina repeated, shocked.

34
00:01:59.228 --> 00:02:01.430
"You're in for a treat today, Izzie."

35
00:02:01.870 --> 00:02:03.111
Miss Shelly smiled.

36
00:02:03.131 --> 00:02:06.754
"First I'll make the fire.

37
00:02:07.874 --> 00:02:10.316
You should each find a long, skinny stick.

38
00:02:11.457 --> 00:02:12.598
Brush off any dirt.

39
00:02:13.619 --> 00:02:17.261
You can peel off the bark, if you'd like," Miss Shelly instructed.

40
00:02:21.785 --> 00:02:23.406
I found a perfect one!"

41
00:02:23.926 --> 00:02:26.108
Nina said, brushing off a long stick.

42
00:02:27.756 --> 00:02:32.059
"We use these to roast the marshmallows," Jason told Izzie.

43
00:02:32.079 --> 00:02:36.502
"Yep. You put the marshmallow on the end of your stick.

44
00:02:37.102 --> 00:02:37.743
Like this."

45
00:02:38.663 --> 00:02:41.085
Bobby showed Izzie how to stab the marshmallow.

46
00:02:42.666 --> 00:02:43.867
Izzie held up her stick.

47
00:02:43.887 --> 00:02:46.489
"Okay, now what?"

48
00:02:47.549 --> 00:02:49.891
"Now let's roast these marshmallows!"

49
00:02:50.391 --> 00:02:51.312
Miss Shelly said.

50
00:02:51.332 --> 00:02:57.376
"Hold your stick carefully over the fire, but not in the fire."

51
00:02:59.024 --> 00:03:00.945
"I like mine gooey and dripping.

52
00:03:01.305 --> 00:03:03.547
That's the best," Nina said.

53
00:03:03.567 --> 00:03:05.668
"No way.

54
00:03:06.188 --> 00:03:10.411
Totally burnt and crispy on the outside is the best," Bobby said.

55
00:03:11.591 --> 00:03:12.532
Izzie screamed.

56
00:03:12.552 --> 00:03:14.553
"Miss Shelly!

57
00:03:14.573 --> 00:03:16.334
My marshmallow is on fire!"

58
00:03:16.354 --> 00:03:18.915
"Don't worry, Izzie.

59
00:03:20.036 --> 00:03:22.417
Just blow it out, like a birthday candle."

60
00:03:23.458 --> 00:03:27.080
Miss Shelly calmly took Izzie's stick and blew out the small flame.

61
00:03:28.548 --> 00:03:29.869
"So this is a s'more?"

62
00:03:30.390 --> 00:03:33.132
Izzie asked, holding up her burnt marshmallow.

63
00:03:34.533 --> 00:03:35.154
"Not yet.

64
00:03:35.634 --> 00:03:39.077
Now we take two graham crackers," Nina said.

65
00:03:39.097 --> 00:03:42.900
"And a piece of chocolate," Jason added.

66
00:03:42.920 --> 00:03:46.223
"Put your chocolate on one graham cracker.

67
00:03:47.264 --> 00:03:49.706
And put your marshmallow on top of the chocolate."

68
00:03:50.747 --> 00:03:51.868
Bobby showed her how.

69
00:03:51.888 --> 00:03:56.572
"Then put your other graham cracker on top, like a sandwich.

70
00:03:57.788 --> 00:03:59.349
And squish it together."

71
00:04:00.570 --> 00:04:02.090
Nina squished her sandwich.

72
00:04:03.351 --> 00:04:05.572
Melted chocolate dripped out of one side.

73
00:04:06.713 --> 00:04:07.974
Izzie and Nina laughed.

74
00:04:13.517 --> 00:04:14.737
are so good!"

75
00:04:15.218 --> 00:04:17.259
Izzie wiped marshmallow off her lips.

76
00:04:17.279 --> 00:04:19.140
"Aren't they?

77
00:04:19.540 --> 00:04:21.341
They're perfect for a fall day."

78
00:04:21.761 --> 00:04:22.962
Miss Shelly smiled.

79
00:04:24.203 --> 00:04:26.424
Izzie looked around at the pretty fall leaves.

80
00:04:27.468 --> 00:04:29.291
Then she looked at her new friend Nina.

81
00:04:30.293 --> 00:04:31.374
Miss Shelly was right.

82
00:04:32.436 --> 00:04:34.499
Everything was perfectly perfect.
